      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;margin-top:0.5rem">Each entry below is a single shipment, with a category tag, a short headline, and the specifics underneath. The same record is kept for every client site I run. If a technical term is unfamiliar, the <a href="/glossary/" class="inline-link">glossary</a> defines every word used on this page.</p>
